{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":25571,"Author":{"Id":288394,"Name":"Msing","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1492644996,"Content":"Hey there, I'm getting married Jan 2018 at the riu palace in Cabo. There's not much on here but 2016 brides about their wedding. I see you've given lots of advice and shared your day openly. I'm hoping you can help me I want to know reception areas, cost, cake, open bar, dinner. Flowers from bajaflowers. I've read they charge you for chairs? Also charging a lot of extra fees that seems ridiculous and overwhelming. <br><br \/>\nAll I know for mine is I'm getting married at the gazebo having the royal package about 35-40 guest (looking at paying extra per person) but not sure yet. <br><br \/>\nHoping you can tell me about yours and give me some insight! <br><br \/>\nThanks on advance!!","PostKey":"9c6c212c0f88cdc838ab87bbb9c9d378","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
